comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-10T22:59:34.849Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence 2026-08-11: all-status search found pm-5t33or, pm-hid9g1, pm-p258tx, and the adaptive-context lineage, but no item owns GH-970 repeated row-contract suppression or reference semantics. Canonical source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/970."
  "2026-08-11T09:18:22.601Z","harness:codex","Evidence 2026-08-11: row contracts remain available to internal projection shaping but are hidden from default CLI, SDK, and MCP answers; --output-row-contract restores discovery metadata. Final-envelope context/read/session token receipts are recalculated after suppression. Contracts, generated fixtures, SDK surface, calibration, completion, packed consumer, and 100% coverage checks pass."
  "2026-08-11T09:18:25.557Z","harness:codex","Observability evidence 2026-08-11: Sentry has zero unresolved issues in 14 days and zero total/unresolved/unhandled issues in 24 hours; the canonical Sentry/telemetry gate passed with critical=0 high=0. Local telemetry contains valid schema-v1 command start/finish, success, latency, and resolution events with zero malformed rows. The collector was independently unreachable during final flush, so 146+ retryable events remain queued without loss; no endpoint, identifiers, or raw payloads are recorded here."
  "2026-08-11T09:59:55.771Z","harness:codex","Review-loop evidence 2026-08-11: row-contract restoration now accepts camelCase and canonical snake_case SDK keys, caller-supplied toon_encoding is validated, NormalizedActivityOptions is nameable by consumers, Zsh/Fish discover the global flag, and stale row-contract suppression has an explicit assertion. Focused CLI/SDK/contract tests pass. The requested pre-merge PM close was declined because canonical lifecycle policy requires keeping actively reviewed work in_progress until exact-head merge evidence exists."
  "2026-08-11T11:01:54.069Z","harness:codex","Merged-head evidence 2026-08-11: PR #977 merged to main at 77bc5a8262e3b2c339d689b6b150d4d4f6371200. All required exact-head GitHub checks passed, all actionable review threads were resolved, and every bot response was read, reacted to, and acknowledged; final CodeRabbit and Sourcery requests were rate-limited and are recorded as provider limitations rather than approval. Local exact coverage passed 7,223 tests across 483 files at 100/100/100/100, and packed CLI/SDK acceptance passed in an isolated temporary project."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-11T09:18:23.253Z","harness:codex","Metadata used to shape a response does not need to be repeated in every response. Suppress it at the final composition boundary, then stabilize all token receipts against the actual envelope so observability stays truthful."
